 "title": "Metallic FM Stab",
 "category": "Leads and stabs",
 "text": "Sound: a harsh, clanging digital stab, struck metal with a pitch: the cold FM hits of industrial and EBM.\n\nHow it's built: FM. A sine modulator two octaves and an odd interval above shakes the carrier (LIN FM) through a VCA opened by a fast envelope, so the clang is all at the start; a short volume envelope; a little Drive and a Reverb. Four voices.\n\nPlay: single hits, short phrases, clusters.\n\nTweak: the modulator's TUNE (each value is a different metal), the carrier's LIN FM, the clang envelope's DECAY.",
